{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43327","headline":"织鸟 · 张何","name":"织鸟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"季春三月里，戴胜下桑来。\n映日华冠动，迎风绣羽开。\n候惊蚕事晚，织向女工裁。\n旅宿依花定，轻飞遶树回。\n欲过高阁柳，更拂小庭梅。\n所寄一枝在，宁忧弋者猜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张何","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43327.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43327","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}